00:07:06.711 --> 00:07:10.744
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:07:11.343 --> 00:07:17.632
<v Slow>キタサンショウウオは、日本のどこにすんでいますか。

00:07:18.432 --> 00:07:21.791
<v Host>Only around the Kushiro Wetland in Hokkaido.

00:07:22.391 --> 00:07:29.519
