00:07:30.319 --> 00:07:33.608
<v Host>Roads and a large solar power plant.

00:07:34.208 --> 00:07:40.232
<v Slow>環境省は、何をすることを決めましたか。

00:07:41.031 --> 00:07:47.656
<v Host>It decided to make part of the area around the national park a protected habitat area for the salamanders.

00:07:48.255 --> 00:07:57.208
<v Host>That's all for today. A tiny salamander, Japan's biggest wetland, and a new plan to keep them safe. See you tomorrow!

